  "details": "# Issue:\nWhen you for example have set your Nameplate Display in the Quick Menu to `Hidden` and then restart your game, the button will now show it set as `Shown` again. This only effects the visuals on the button, it's still actually set to `Hidden` internally and nameplates wont actually show up.\n# Attachments:\nIn the first picture you can see what I've set it to before I restarted, in the second on you can see it displaying as `Shown` after restarting and in the third one you can see that it's not actually showing the nameplate:",
